<title>USA: Illinois direct hogs $0.50/1.00 higher - USDA.</title>
<headline>Illinois direct hogs $0.50/1.00 higher - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SPRINGFIELD 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were $0.50-1.00 higher. Demand moderate. Top $57.50 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US 1-2  230-260 lbs.  56.50-57.50</p>
<p>US 2-3  230-260 lbs.  55.50-56.50</p>
<p>Sows: Under 500 lbs. steady to weak; over 500 lbs. Steady to firm. Top 50.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3  300-500 lbs. 41.00-45.00</p>
<p>	  500-600 lbs. 45.00-48.00</p>
<p>few over 600 lbs. 47.50-49.00, few 50.00</p>
</text>
